# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command whoami
usage 1   whoami                        print the account this shell is currently running as

case root, then another account
target none
covers 1
$ whoami
out 4
root
status 0
action none
$ useradd tester
out 20
Added user 'tester'.
status 0
action none
$ su tester
out 21
Switched to 'tester'.
status 0
action none
$ whoami
out 6
tester
status 0
action none
$ su
out 19
Switched to 'root'.
status 0
action none
$ whoami
out 4
root
status 0
action none
end
